# V11.A — orchestrator runtime fix (fence-one-no-edit)

2026-05-03. v0.1.2 load-bearing item per
`docs/rebuild/plans/v0-1-x-roadmap.md` §2 v0.1.2 item 1.
Sub-plan: `docs/rebuild/plans/v0-1-2-V11-A-orchestrator-fix.md`.
Empirical orchestrator-state observation:
`<workspace>/.scratch/claude-output/orchestrator-state-2026-05-02.md`.

Scope (per sub-plan §4 + §6): fence-one-no-edit on
`framework/orchestrator/`. ZERO source-side edits inside
`src/`, `ops/`, or `scripts/`. Bookkeeping-only seal: sidecar
SEAL_COMMIT advance + BASELINE literal bump in
`tests/test_no_sealed_amendments.py`. Mirrors FBE.4's fence-
three-no-edit precedent (`docs/rebuild/plans/v0-1-0-foldback-
scope-expansion-fbe4.md` §1 + AC.FBE.4.S).

The dispatcher's two named source-side buckets are pre-resolved:
